From 5f17d5332227ba83d5433d119e4719581f9a2568 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Clarke <sanity@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Mar 2026 10:11:29 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 35/69] fix(ui): revert mobile responsive layout that broke
 inside gateway iframe
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The mobile responsive layout from PR #142 used flex-col + position:fixed
wrappers that caused sidebars to disappear when rendered inside the
Freenet gateway's sandboxed iframe. Revert to the original flat flex
row layout. The newline rendering fix (span→div) is preserved.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 ui/src/components/app.rs       | 98 ++--------------------------------
 ui/src/components/members.rs   | 16 ++----
 ui/src/components/room_list.rs |  9 ++--
 3 files changed, 12 insertions(+), 111 deletions(-)

